  "title": "Wells Fargo introduces AI Teammate, bringing AI-powered support to the advisor experience",
  "summary": "Watch a video to see how AI Teammate simplifies everyday work and helps advisors identify opportunities to grow their practices. SAN FRANCISCO – Wells Fargo today announced the launch of AI Teammate, a new artificial intelligence (AI)–powered capability embedded within Advisor Gateway that helps streamline how financial advisors, client associates, and support teams access information and complete everyday work. AI Teammate marks a milestone in Wells Fargo’s broader effort to apply AI",
